{
    "title": "Detecht - Motorcycle App & GPS",
    "description": "Looking for an all-in-one motorcycle app that can help you plan your next motorcycle trip and ensure your safety on the road? Look no further than Detecht! Whether you're an experienced rider or just starting out, Detecht has got you covered!\r\n\r\nWith a range of features designed specifically for motorcyclists, Detecht is the ultimate app to help you stay safe, plan & navigate your routes, and find other riders to ride with.\r\n\r\nThe #1 app for people who love riding, motorcylces and want to share their passion with fellow riders. \ud83c\udfcd\ud83d\ude0e\r\n\r\nSafety First \ud83d\udea8\u26d1\r\nDetecht's top priority is your safety. With automatic crash detection, safety tracking, and hazard warnings, you can ride with confidence, knowing that Detecht is always looking out for you. \r\n\r\n- Automatic Crash Detection: Alerts your emergency contacts in the event of an accident\r\n- Safety Tracking: Keeps you connected to your loved ones with real-time location sharing\r\n- Hazard Warnings: Notifies you of potential hazards along your route\r\n\r\nPlan Your Ride \ud83d\uddfa\ud83d\udccd\r\nWith Detecht's route planning features, you can create and navigate the perfect trip with just a few taps. Whether you're looking for curvy routes or round trips, Detecht has got you covered. \r\n\r\n- Curvy Routes: Select curvy routes or autogenerate a round trip for an exciting and thrilling ride with plenty of twists and curves.\r\n- Customize Trips: Plan trips based on your preferences with stops, waypoints, and more\r\n- User-Tracked Routes: Choose from over hundreds of thousands of user-tracked routes to find the one that's right for you\r\n- Turn-by-Turn Navigation: Motorcycle specific GPS navigation and voice guidance\r\n\r\nConnect with Riders \ud83d\ude0e\r\nDetecht's rider community is a great way to connect with other riders. \r\n\r\n- Community: Find new riding buddies, plan and share rides together or compare stats. Join and experience the Detecht family with over 500 000 motorcyclists around the world\r\n- Social Feed: Share experiences and stay up to date on the latest news and trends\r\n\r\n<b>Other Handy Features</b>\r\n\r\nIn addition to the safety, route planning, and community features, Detecht also offers other handy tools for motorcyclists, such as:\r\n\r\n- GPX Support: Easily import and export your routes\r\n- Ride Statistics: Track your progress and see how far you've come\r\n\r\nWhether you're a seasoned rider or just starting out, Detecht is the ultimate app for all motorcyclists. Download Detecht today and take your riding to the next level.\r\n\r\nDetecht premium is available as an optional upgrade with three different periods, 1 month, 6 months and 12 months. The subscriptions include full access to Turn-by-turn navigation, Round Trips, Curvy Roads Mode, Safety Tracking, up to 5 Emergency Contacts, GPX Export and Import and some new upcoming features!\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://detechtapp.com/terms-of-use\r\nPrivacy policy: https://detechtapp.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for an all-in-one motorcycle app that can help you plan your next motorcycle trip and ensure your safety on the road? Look no further than Detecht! Whether you&#39;re an experienced rider or just starting out, Detecht has got you covered!<br><br>With a range of features designed specifically for motorcyclists, Detecht is the ultimate app to help you stay safe, plan &amp; navigate your routes, and find other riders to ride with.<br><br>The #1 app for people who love riding, motorcylces and want to share their passion with fellow riders. \ud83c\udfcd\ud83d\ude0e<br><br>Safety First \ud83d\udea8\u26d1<br>Detecht&#39;s top priority is your safety. With automatic crash detection, safety tracking, and hazard warnings, you can ride with confidence, knowing that Detecht is always looking out for you. <br><br>- Automatic Crash Detection: Alerts your emergency contacts in the event of an accident<br>- Safety Tracking: Keeps you connected to your loved ones with real-time location sharing<br>- Hazard Warnings: Notifies you of potential hazards along your route<br><br>Plan Your Ride \ud83d\uddfa\ud83d\udccd<br>With Detecht&#39;s route planning features, you can create and navigate the perfect trip with just a few taps. Whether you&#39;re looking for curvy routes or round trips, Detecht has got you covered. <br><br>- Curvy Routes: Select curvy routes or autogenerate a round trip for an exciting and thrilling ride with plenty of twists and curves.<br>- Customize Trips: Plan trips based on your preferences with stops, waypoints, and more<br>- User-Tracked Routes: Choose from over hundreds of thousands of user-tracked routes to find the one that&#39;s right for you<br>- Turn-by-Turn Navigation: Motorcycle specific GPS navigation and voice guidance<br><br>Connect with Riders \ud83d\ude0e<br>Detecht&#39;s rider community is a great way to connect with other riders. <br><br>- Community: Find new riding buddies, plan and share rides together or compare stats. Join and experience the Detecht family with over 500 000 motorcyclists around the world<br>- Social Feed: Share experiences and stay up to date on the latest news and trends<br><br><b>Other Handy Features</b><br><br>In addition to the safety, route planning, and community features, Detecht also offers other handy tools for motorcyclists, such as:<br><br>- GPX Support: Easily import and export your routes<br>- Ride Statistics: Track your progress and see how far you&#39;ve come<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a seasoned rider or just starting out, Detecht is the ultimate app for all motorcyclists. Download Detecht today and take your riding to the next level.<br><br>Detecht premium is available as an optional upgrade with three different periods, 1 month, 6 months and 12 months. The subscriptions include full access to Turn-by-turn navigation, Round Trips, Curvy Roads Mode, Safety Tracking, up to 5 Emergency Contacts, GPX Export and Import and some new upcoming features!<br><br>Terms of use: https://detechtapp.com/terms-of-use<br>Privacy policy: https://detechtapp.com/privacy-policy",
